xt":"オイラたち、よく治安維持に協力してるから、その時に見たのかな？","nextNodeIds":[745160113,745160116]},{"nodeId":745160113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3230330666,"text":"初めまして、どこかで会った警察隊員さん！","nextNodeIds":[745160114]},{"nodeId":745160114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":4025049914,"text":"あははっ、そんなにかしこまらなくても！またこうやって会うこともあるだろうしさ。ほらほら、肩の力抜いて～。","nextNodeIds":[745160115]},{"nodeId":745160115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":1108539242,"text":"そうじゃないと、今度なにかあって助けてもらうとき、こっちはもっと真面目でかしこまった態度を取らないといけなくなっちゃうでしょ？そんなの疲れちゃう。ぜったいムリムリ。","nextNodeIds":[745160121]},{"nodeId":745160121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":1819990322,"text":"うへぇ…こんなに長く仕事してたなんて。やっとあがれる…","nextNodeIds":[745160122]},{"nodeId":745160122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":514095394,"text":"ザ・ラスティ・ラダーで何杯か飲んで、あいつと密放流者が新聞でボロクソに言われるのを待とうかなぁと思うんだけど…一緒にどお？","nextNodeIds":[745160123]},{"nodeId":745160123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30773,"speakerName":"ジュリア","textMapHash":3891513002,"text":"素敵なお誘いありがとう、アンジェニーナさん。でも警戒を怠るわけにはいかないわ、しぶとい外来種のことだから、何が起きるか分からないもの。","nextNodeIds":[745160124]},{"nodeId":745160124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30773,"speakerName":"ジュリア","textMapHash":2963689594,"text":"この水域の外来種をすべて駆逐できたら…絶対ご一緒させて！","nextNodeIds":[745160125]},{"nodeId":745160125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":1533474346,"text":"おお！まだまだやる気満々だねぇ。しばらくは忙しそうだし、じゃあまた今度。約束だよ！","nextNodeIds":[745160126]},{"nodeId":745160126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":3577034410,"text":"全身全霊、全力で頑張ってね！","nextNodeIds":[745160127]},{"nodeId":745160127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3697161874,"text":"ジュリアは水辺に戻って、引き続き水域の監視を始めた…","nextNodeIds":[745160128]},{"nodeId":745160128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1510870186,"text":"ジュリアさん…頑張りすぎじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[745160129]},{"nodeId":745160129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":1130516810,"text":"うーん、私の予想だとねぇ…昔、責任感がすごく強い人を見て、感銘を受けたんだと思うよ。気持ちはすごくわかるなぁ。","nextNodeIds":[745160130]},{"nodeId":745160130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":1499177682,"text":"あの勢いを見ちゃうと、サボってられないね。","nextNodeIds":[745160131,745160133]},{"nodeId":745160131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3034635626,"text":"やる気があるのはいいこと。","nextNodeIds":[745160132]},{"nodeId":745160132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3940686890,"text":"#ずっと努力し続けるのもすごいことだけど、{NICKNAME}を見習って適度に休憩するのも大事だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[745160135]},{"nodeId":745160135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":3318896106,"text":"じゃあ、私がタイムマネジメントのコツが知りたいって言ったら、教えないってのはナシだよ！","nextNodeIds":[745160136]},{"nodeId":745160136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":2160986018,"text":"とにかく…今回の作戦の経費——特に二人の報酬を申請するとき…金額は「メイン艦砲稼働レベル」にしてもらわないとね。","nextNodeIds":[745160137]},{"nodeId":745160137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":95456250,"text":"次も面倒なことがあったときは、現場に君たちがいて…","nextNodeIds":[745160138]},{"nodeId":745160138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":1626851482,"text":"腰に手をあてて、笑顔でこういってくれるといいんだけどなぁ。「一件落着！」って。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745160133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2805338602,"text":"努力と休憩のバランスは大事。","nextNodeIds":[745160134]},{"nodeId":745160134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2469070434,"text":"#そうそう、{NICKNAME}はそれをよくわかってるからな！","nextNodeIds":[745160135]},{"nodeId":745160116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":741974858,"text":"前も一緒に色々やったよね、警察隊員さん。","nextNodeIds":[745160117]},{"nodeId":745160117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":2568073346,"text":"覚えてくれてたんだ！よかった～！","nextNodeIds":[745160118]},{"nodeId":745160118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","textMapHash":2563469850,"text":"今度会ったときは同僚のように気軽に話してよね！恐る恐る話すのはナシ！","nextNodeIds":[745160119,745160120]},{"nodeId":745160119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":408039626,"text":"うん、気軽にいこう。","nextNodeIds":[745160121]},{"nodeId":745160120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2741910314,"text":"なにかあったらお互い助け合おう！","nextNodeIds":[745160121]},{"nodeId":745160110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":725507266,"text":"艦砲の使い方も勉強したいね。","nextNodeIds":[745160111]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7451601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30773"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7451601],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30784,"speakerName":"アンジェニーナ","count":17},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":8},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30773,"speakerName":"ジュリア","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"spea